explain_corpus: DIAGNOSTIC ONLY -- this is `check_auto_explained` on the FLAT assertion view, not the shipped front door. Measured 2026-08-21 it disagreed with `solve_smtlib` on 134 of 397 committed benchmarks. Every verdict below is prefixed `flat-` or `front-door-` for that reason. For an answer, run `smtcomp_cli` (which IS `solve_smtlib`); pass --confirm to have this tool cross-check itself.
